				"&lBand 3 (for space-based factories): no profit"
				""
				"&lperfect frequency modulation (zero error in three frequency bands):"
				"&l• Integration factory: lossy overclocking→lossless overclocking"
				"&l• Advanced factory: cross-recipe thread × 2"
				"&l• Tianji Factory: Double the recipe output"
